instrument wingie
; wingie-ground — the room as the instrument: Tuned to the Ground, I Am Sitting in a Room,
; and Metastaseis. fader1 Mix, fader2 Decay, fader3 the scene's own

2026-11-24 tuned to the ground
------------------------------
; hold mode1 and let the place sound (clap, stomp, hum, traffic); let go and the nine
; resonators take its strongest resonances. Keys strike them; mode2 lets them ring with dust.
the ground is listen
the motes is dust 2
the mix is crossfade

mic.both -> ground
mode1 -> ground.listen
keys1.trig keys2.trig -> ground.strike
motes.pulse ?30> ground.strike
fader2 -> ground.decay
fader3 -> motes.density
mic.both -> mix.a
ground -> mix.b
fader1 -> mix.mix
mix -> out
ground.locked -> lights.left
motes.pulse -> lights.right

2026-11-24 sitting in a room
----------------------------
; speak into the Wingie. fader3 is how many times the room has heard it (0 to 32);
; the keys pick nothing, the room picks. fader1 Mix with your own voice
the room is sittingroom 1
the mix is crossfade

mic.both -> room
fader3 -> room.generations
mic.both -> mix.a
room -> mix.b
fader1 -> mix.mix
mix -> out
room.room -> lights.left lights.right

2026-11-24 metastaseis
----------------------
; nine resonances glide from a unison to a cluster and back, a tap on mode1 each way;
; the left keys set where the unison stands, fader3 the dust, mode2 held staggers them
the mass is metastaseis 20 chordb=cluster cycle=off
the mix is crossfade

mic.both -> mass
mode1.tap -> mass.go
keys1.pitch -> mass.pitch
mode2 -> mass.stagger
fader3 -> mass.density
fader2 -> mass.decay
mic.both -> mix.a
mass.l -> mix.b
fader1 -> mix.mix
mix -> left
mass.r -> right
mass.pos -> lights.left
mass.l -> lights.right
